        "summary": "Real-time, 3D NBA basketball simulation with online league capabilities. More responsive \"juke\" controls for one-on-one isolation moves. Gamers can play up to 25 NBA seasons with full general management capabilities. All-new Drive Cam camera angle brings the player closer to the action. For 1 or more players (online gaming requires Internet connection). Features 3D crowd.",
